* Paying off a loan: 5000 at 6 per cent a year, 430.33 a month.
* The table shows the debt at the end of each month.
1.1 Set i = d·r/1200.
1.2 Set d = d + i - p.
1.3 Type m, i, d in form 1.
Form 1:
month __   interest ___.__   still owing _____.__
Form 2:
The last payment is ___.__

Set d = 5000.
Set r = 6.
Set p = 430.33.
Do part 1 for m = 1(1)12.
